1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Find the role. Own the next step.
One workspace for your search, your evidence and your applications.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:16,000
A workspace built around your next move.
Use the sidebar to move between opportunities, documents and progress.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Start with the facts.
Settings → professional profile → review and save your application details.

4
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Every version. Every qualification.
CV Studio → source library → qualifications → versioned document preview.

5
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Show the work behind the skills.
Portfolio → verified achievements, technologies, links and reusable evidence.

6
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:32,000
Make the search focused.
Pipeline → roles and locations → CV routing → sources → preview the work.

7
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:48,000
Decide where to spend your attention.
Jobs → search → open the record → review the evidence → Pick.

8
00:01:48,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Turn criteria into reviewed documents.
Cover Studio + Statement Studio → target → draft → validate → preview.

9
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:24,000
Prepare the packet. Inspect the work.
Pipeline → Prepare selected applications → preview queues and recovery.

10
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Apply with visibility and control.
Review the packet → open the shared browser → take over → final review.

11
00:02:50,000 --> 00:03:04,000
Keep the next conversation in context.
Applications → hiring status → notes → reminder → calendar export.

12
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:18,000
Turn messages into next steps.
Evidence inbox → import → inspect the source → review the hiring update.

13
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:38,000
See the story behind your progress.
Insights → interactive charts → drill down → export the underlying records.

14
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:47,000
Clear the clutter. Keep the story.
History & storage → closure reasons → retained timeline → storage controls.

15
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:56,000
Make the workspace yours.
Settings → private AI connections → task routing → portable backup.

16
00:03:56,000 --> 00:04:00,000
Your next chapter, organized.
ApplyPilot / Your application workspace
